.OP-06 -- `FinalizeGroceryRun`
[cols="1,4", stripes=even]
|===
| Field | Specification

| Performer
| Flutter mobile app / grocery-list repository, activated by household member.

| Input variables
| Checked grocery-list entries, bought quantities, optional expiration dates, optional receipt/spending data, household ID, user ID.

| Output variables
| Updated inventory records, archived/cleared checked grocery entries, restock log, optional spending entry, refreshed UI.

| Domain preconditions
| Checked grocery-list items represent items bought during a shopping trip. Some purchased items may need quantity and expiration details before restocking.

