| User taps *Finalize Grocery Run*, reviews purchase summary, and confirms *Save & Restock*.

| Required postconditions
| For each confirmed item, inventory is inserted or updated with quantity and expiration data. Checked entries are cleared or archived. A restocking action is logged. Optional spending data is saved. User sees confirmation and updated inventory.

